  "site_name": "8 Chaplin Road, London, NW2 5PN",
  "description": "Purpose of This Application\nThis application seeks planning permission for the construction of a single-storey side infill extension at 8 Chaplin Road. The proposed extension will align\nprecisely with the back wall of the existing rear extension and with neighbouring extensions. The proposal is designed to create a cohesive rear building line, improve internal functionality, and make efficient use of the available plot while maintaining the character and amenity of the surrounding properties. The proposed single storey side extension will significantly enhance the quality of the existing living space, creating a seamless, open-plan layout for the family to enjoy together.",
